  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/MwtvPUyQVK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Discord邀请链接\"></a></p><p><strong>机械动力：蒸汽之音</strong>为Minecraft添加了多种不同音色的管风琴音栓，拓展了Minecraft音乐技术的边界。</p><p><strong>音栓列表：</strong></p><ul>\n<li>盖特笛</li>\n<li>主音管</li>\n<li>低音维奥尔</li>\n<li>短笛</li>\n<li>低音提琴</li>\n<li>小号</li>\n<li>纳萨尔德</li>\n<li>长号</li>\n<li>人声音栓</li>\n<li>中提琴</li>\n<li>天籁音栓</li>\n<li>英国管</li>\n<li>柔音长笛</li>\n<li>空腔长笛</li>\n<li>显示音栓</li>\n<li>幽魂蒸汽汽笛</li>\n</ul><p>更多音栓即将到来！</p><hr><p>请记住，这是<strong><em>早期测试版</em></strong>。会有大量漏洞，我会逐步修复。如果您发现任何漏洞，欢迎在模组的GitHub仓库或官方Discord服务器中报告。</p><p><strong>机械动力：蒸汽之音</strong>支持<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>和<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fneoforged.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a>平台。</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KAgud6s.png\" width=\"160\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fneoforged.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/90zvX3m.png\" width=\"160\"></a></p>",
